# Schema 要点
+ RepoResponse / SyncResponse
+ ProjectResponse: repo/project/envs/default_env/archived/commit_sha（移除 assets_root/config_root/env）
+ RunRequest/CaseRunRequest: 必填 env
+ RunResponse/CaseRunResponse: commit_sha
+ ExecutionRecord*: env/commit_sha/repo/operator
- ProjectCreate / ProjectUpdate
